    "description": "<p>A new patch release in the 26.0.x series. This release fixes dummy-scan handling in the tedana and t2smap workflows. The associated bug was introduced in 26.0.0, so if you are using a release in the 26.0.x series and rely on the <code>--dummy-scans</code> parameter, we recommend updating to 26.0.3.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Account for dummy scans in workflows by @tsalo in https://github.com/ME-ICA/tedana/pull/1402</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: https://github.com/ME-ICA/tedana/compare/26.0.2...26.0.3</p>"
  },
