    "description_stripped": "A new patch release in the 26.0.x series. This release fixes dummy-scan handling in the tedana and t2smap workflows. The associated bug was introduced in 26.0.0, so if you are using a release in the 26.0.x series and rely on the --dummy-scans parameter, we recommend updating to 26.0.3.\n\nWhat's Changed\n\n🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n\n\nAccount for dummy scans in workflows by @tsalo in https://github.com/ME-ICA/tedana/pull/1402\n\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/ME-ICA/tedana/compare/26.0.2...26.0.3",
